 "remarks": "Welcome to 42 Woodbine Road, a stunning modern farmhouse built in 2023 that delivers all the benefits of new construction without the wait. Impeccably maintained and in pristine condition, this turnkey home is truly move-in ready with nothing left to do. The main level welcomes you with sophisticated living spaces that flow seamlessly into an incredible kitchen with beverage bar. French doors open directly to an entertaining deck for effortless indoor-outdoor living. Upstairs, the luxurious master suite features a gorgeous en-suite bath and a large walk-in closet, accompanied by a guest suite with a hotel-style en-suite bath, two additional bedrooms with massive walk-in closets, and a versatile second-floor office/flex space. The upper level expands your living options with a finished third-floor walk-up ideal for a playroom or bonus area. The lower walk-out level boasts an expansive exercise room and a media/entertaining area. Outside, enjoy crisp evenings around the backyard firepit. Complete with a whole-house generator, 1,000-gallon gas tank, Nest camera, and Sonos system, this exceptional home in prime Stamford has everything a modern life needs.",
